/P 231 0 R
/E (Few organisations recover everything that was taken. The money is spent, moved, or untraceable, and the legal route is slow and expensive. Many organisations also choose to handle fraud quietly, preferring an internal dismissal to a public case, because they fear the publicity.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
