513 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 235 0 R
/E (I would examine fraud through the lens of the Fraud Triangle: Pressure, Opportunity and Rationalisation. While personal motives may explain why someone committed fraud, weaknesses in the control environment often explain how they succeeded.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
514 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 235 0 R
