/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 236 0 R
/E (them to find the gap between what is written and what is done. So ask not "Do we have a control for this?" but "When did this control last stop something?" If nobody can answer, you may only have the illusion of one.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [16]
>>
